Droid Sans Fallback subset
Copyright 2006–2010 Google Corp. Droid is a trademark of Google Corp.

This file is a subset of Droid Sans Fallback, kept so the Tea mascot can draw
Japanese and Simplified Chinese when the operating system has no CJK font.
The UI font is used first; this face only supplies glyphs the UI font lacks.
It is not a general-purpose CJK font: a file name outside this character set
still needs a system font.

