http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Source: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/
Subset generated with fontTools pyftsubset from the characters in
crates/tea-app/i18n/{ja,zh-CN}/tea-app.ftl plus the language names 日本語 and 中文（简体）.
